<!--
  Dogs mate (Continued) (Mlie.DogsMate, Workshop 2441132298, Mlie after Revolus).

  Since 1.6 added crossbreeding the mod uses the vanilla system. It still keeps a list of animal groups,
  Revolus.DogsMate.AnimalGroupDef (1.6/Defs/CompatibleSpecies/*.xml), each with a <pawnKinds> list; at game
  start it makes every kind of a group mate with the others, and it shows "Can mate with" on the info card.
  Its own compatibility patches do the same thing: add a PawnKindDef defName to the group's pawnKinds.

  Four of our animals are described, in their own text, as a member of a vanilla group:

    MM_Cerberus           "a three-headed dog"                Dog   (Husky, LabradorRetriever, YorkshireTerrier)
    MM_ErymanthianBoar    "a gargantuan, monstrous wild hog"  Pig   (WildBoar, Pig)
    MM_CeryneianHind      "the form of an enormous deer"      Deer  (Deer, Elk, Caribou)
    MM_Pegasus            "a mythical winged divine horse"    Horse (Horse)

  NOT GROUPED, on purpose. The text never says the animal IS one of the group, only that it looks like
  one: Ahuizotl ("dog-like"), Kitsune ("fox-like"), Catoblepas ("the body of a cape buffalo"), Qilin
  ("shaped like a deer", partially scaled), Wild Minotaur and Xiezhi (a bull; a lion and a goat: no group
  covers them), Kappa (human-like with a carapace). The others have no vanilla group at all: Unicorn (the
  text names no animal), Griffin, Manticore, Chimera, the birds (Phoenix, Fenghuang, Ieltxu, Stymphalian
  Bird), the snakes (Basilisk, Salamander, Tlilcoatl), Lernaean Hydra, Lesser Wyvern, Will-o'-Wisp.

  The guard is a PatchOperationConditional on the group itself (Dogs mate's own patches guard on the
  ThingDef). Without Dogs mate the group does not exist, the xpath selects nothing, and the operation
  reports success and logs nothing. No load order: the groups are Defs, read after every patch, and the
  crosscheck runs at game start.

  The same four pairs are written for Better Crossbreeding in BetterCrossbreedingPatch.xml.
-->
<Patch>

	<Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
		<xpath>/Defs/Revolus.DogsMate.AnimalGroupDef[defName="Dog"]/pawnKinds</xpath>
		<match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
			<xpath>/Defs/Revolus.DogsMate.AnimalGroupDef[defName="Dog"]/pawnKinds</xpath>
			<value>
				<li>MM_Cerberus</li>
			</value>
		</match>
	</Operation>

	<Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
		<xpath>/Defs/Revolus.DogsMate.AnimalGroupDef[defName="Pig"]/pawnKinds</xpath>
		<match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
			<xpath>/Defs/Revolus.DogsMate.AnimalGroupDef[defName="Pig"]/pawnKinds</xpath>
			<value>
				<li>MM_ErymanthianBoar</li>
			</value>
		</match>
	</Operation>

	<Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
		<xpath>/Defs/Revolus.DogsMate.AnimalGroupDef[defName="Deer"]/pawnKinds</xpath>
		<match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
			<xpath>/Defs/Revolus.DogsMate.AnimalGroupDef[defName="Deer"]/pawnKinds</xpath>
			<value>
				<li>MM_CeryneianHind</li>
			</value>
		</match>
	</Operation>

	<Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
		<xpath>/Defs/Revolus.DogsMate.AnimalGroupDef[defName="Horse"]/pawnKinds</xpath>
		<match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
			<xpath>/Defs/Revolus.DogsMate.AnimalGroupDef[defName="Horse"]/pawnKinds</xpath>
			<value>
				<li>MM_Pegasus</li>
			</value>
		</match>
	</Operation>

</Patch>
